title: Right of Way
text: Two lines, two level crossings. Each train changes colour on the way and has to stop before the signal at the end of its line.
trick: a doppler passes light on one axis and swallows it on the other: on a crossing it recolours the through train and stops the other. Each train is stopped by the doppler that recolours the other
motif: a rail plan: walled tracks with sidings; the black targets are the signals at the ends of the two lines
expect: recolours>=2
---
L 0 2 2 r
L 14 11 6 y
*D 4 2 0 k
*R 12 2 7 k
*R 12 6 1 k
*R 8 6 5 k
*D 8 11 0 k
*R 4 11 3 k
T 8 8 0 b
T 4 6 0 c
T 8 13 0 k
T 4 0 0 k
